<title>USA: Amphenol shareholders approve merger.</title>
<headline>Amphenol shareholders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>WALLINGFORD, Conn. 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amphenol Corp said on Wednesday that its shareholders approved its previously announced merger with an affiliate of Kohlberg Kravis Roberts &amp; Co.</p>
<p>The merger transaction is scheduled to close on May 19.</p>
<p>Amphenol makes connectors, cable and interconnect systems for various applications.</p>
